  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water is life Niger</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To build the resilience of households in Niger by increasing sustainable access to water and influencing water governance at a local, regional and national level.  Specific Objectives 1) Provide sustainable access to clean, safe water for domestic and agricultural use by constructing and rehabilitating water points  2) Influence the government by piloting the national plan for integrated water resource management and training government agents and community groups 3) Share learning across civil society organisations by delivering two multi -stakeholder workshops with representatives from International Non -Government Organisations in Niger</narrative>
  </description>
